__pycache__/
*.pyc
sl_audit_results.zip
bundle/
.kaggle_job/
.env

# Cygwin/MSYS crash dumps from the Bash tool on Windows
*.stackdump

# Notebooks downloaded back from Kaggle with cell outputs embedded. These are
# run artefacts, not source: 100KB+ each, they churn on every run, and the
# source of truth is scripts/kaggle_run.py which regenerates the notebook.
sl-audit-probe-downloaded-with-outputs*.ipynb

# Model outputs stay out of git. transcripts.jsonl and labeled.jsonl hold
# unredacted completions naming real politicians; REPORT.md quotes only
# mechanically-redacted fragments but is still derived from them. Share these
# with the submission directly rather than publishing them.
# repo_identity.json is exempt: sha256 shard hashes only, no model output, and
# it is the evidence for the organism-C finding cited in the README.
results/*
!results/repo_identity.json
# The figure is a derived summary statistic, not a model output.
!results/figure1_fire_rates.png
!results/fire_rates.md
!results/figure2_depth_profile.png
!results/lens_margins.json
sl-audit-BASE-LENS.ipynb
/sl-audit-*-downloaded-with-outputs.ipynb
/sl-audit-*.ipynb
# ...but notebooks/ is where the run outputs are kept deliberately, as
# the evidence behind the report. Anchor the rules above to the root so
# they catch fresh downloads without swallowing the archive.
!notebooks/**
sl-audit-WEIGHT-DIFF.ipynb
sl-audit-RESCORE.ipynb

# REPORT.md and SUPPLEMENT.md are tracked deliberately: they are the
# deliverable, and the submission links to them. Both quote only mechanically
# redacted fragments -- cut at the first instruction-like marker and capped at
# 320 characters -- while the unredacted completions stay out of the repo.

# Word lock files
~$*

# Organiser-supplied material and other participants Discord messages:
# mirrored here while working, not ours to republish.
help-desk-messages.md
Hackathon-Guidelines.md
Hackathon-Resources.md
HACKATHON_EXECUTION_PLAN.md
Apart Research Secret Loyalties Hackathon Resources.md
Secret Loyalties Hackathon Detection Challenge (Participant Brief).md
Secret Loyatlies - Organism Walkthrough.md
Copy of Secret Loytalties Hackathon submission template.md

# Superseded build outputs; submission.docx is regenerated by md_to_docx.py
submission-v2.docx
submission-final.docx
submission-v3.docx
Copy of Secret Loytalties Hackathon submission template.docx
submission-new.docx

# Forward research agenda, not part of the submission. Publishing a workplan
# before doing the work is a real cost with no benefit to a reader.
RESEARCH-PLAN.md
Untitled-2.html
entries.json
entries.txt
